, astonishment","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Overraskelsen var en stor fest.","ex_tr":"The surprise was a big party."},{"term":"en ro","tr":"calm, tranquility","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Jeg liker roen i fjellene.","ex_tr":"I like the calmness in the mountains."},{"term":"en misunnelse","tr":"envy, jealousy","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Misunnelsen gjorde ham bitter.","ex_tr":"The envy made him bitter."},{"term":"en stolthet","tr":"pride, self‑respect","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Stoltheten over resultatet var stor.","ex_tr":"The pride over the result was great."},{"term":"en skam","tr":"shame, disgrace","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Skammen over feilen var tydelig.","ex_tr":"The shame over the mistake was obvious."},{"term":"en bekymring","tr":"worry, concern","pos":"noun","forms":"","ex":"Bekymringen hennes for barnet er naturlig.","ex_tr":"Her worry for the child is natural."},{"term":"å føle","tr":"to feel","pos":"verb","forms":"føler, følte, har følt","ex":"Jeg føler meg glad i dag.","ex_tr":"I feel happy today.","chk":1},{"term":"å bli","tr":"to become","pos":"verb","forms":"blir, ble, har blitt","ex":"Han blir sint når han er sulten.","ex_tr":"He becomes angry when he is hungry.","chk":1},{"term":"å elske","tr":"to love","pos":"verb","forms":"elsker, elska, har elska","ex":"Jeg elsker å lese bøker.","ex_tr":"I love to read books.","chk":1},{"term":"å hate","tr":"to hate","pos":"verb","forms":"","ex":"Hun hater å stå i kø.","ex_tr":"She hates standing in line."},{"term":"å irritere","tr":"to irritate","pos":"verb","forms":"","ex":"Lyden irriterer meg.","ex_tr":"The sound irritates me."},{"term":"å roe seg","tr":"to calm down","pos":"verb","forms":"","ex":"Han prøver å roe seg etter krangelen.","ex_tr":"He tries to calm down after the argument."},{"term":"å gråte","tr":"to cry","pos":"verb","forms":"gråter, gråt, har grått","ex":"Hun gråter når hun ser filmen.","ex_tr":"She cries when she watches the movie.","chk":1}]}
